{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VwLzhzPZvQuSEfcN7FzGDp","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '放弃 ''discover→diagnose→remedy'' 弧。Llama SS 失败（AR GAR β=0 ≈ 0.04，gap\n2\t  ~12×）证明 SS 是 model-specific，不可泛化为 general mitigation。 Reframe 为纯 mechanistic diagnostic\n3\t  paper。Title 改为 ''Why Auxiliary Attention Losses Fail Under Exposure Bias: A Multi-Model\n4\t  Diagnostic Study''。 SS 从 Results 独立小节降级为 Discussion ''attempted mitigation''，承认\n5\t  model-specific 局限。核心卖点转为 failure mode taxonomy （NF1 反向 turn conditioning + NF2 distribution\n6\t  shift + NF3 干预强度不足）的系统分类学价值。 加强 PCGrad ''first empirical elimination of gradient\n7\t  conflict hypothesis'' 叙事。加强 Dongre convergent failure evidence： 两种干预 × 两种模型 = 4\n8\t  paths all fail on Llama。Introduction 结尾加 ''our negative results establish concrete\n9\t  failure modes that future work must overcome''。Discussion 加 concrete next steps（data-dependent\n10\t  SS schedule、curriculum exposure、inference-time only）。 仍冲 EMNLP Findings 2.5-3.0，靠\n11\t  systematic rigor + cross-model replication + failure taxonomy。 审稿人 novelty objection\n12\t  probability 0.7-1.0，fatal/severe concerns 3-5 remaining。\n13\t\n14\t  '\n15\timagined_experiments:\n16\t- name: Llama Gradient Conflict Analysis\n17\t  plan_id: plan_013\n18\t  description: 'Llama-3.1-8B 上对 3 个 epoch checkpoint 计算 NTP-GAR 梯度 cos_sim 和 magnitude\n19\t    ratio， 验证梯度方向冲突是否跨模型存在。\n20\t\n21\t    '\n22\t  expected_results:\n23\t    cos_sim_mean: 0.005\n24\t    cos_sim_std: 0.07\n25\t    neg_cos_sim_layers_pct: 53.1\n26\t    pos_cos_sim_layers_pct: 46.9\n27\t    mag_ratio_median: 25.7\n28\t    mag_ratio_range: '[12.0, 45.0]'\n29\t    epoch0_cos_sim: 0.012\n30\t    epoch0_neg_layers_pct: 50.0\n31\t    epoch1_cos_sim: 0.003\n32\t    epoch1_neg_layers_pct: 53.1\n33\t    epoch2_cos_sim: -0.001\n34\t    epoch2_neg_layers_pct: 56.3\n35\t    gpu_hours: 0.3\n36\t  result_rationale: 'Worst case：Llama 梯度是 near-orthogonal（cos_sim ≈ 0），不是 conflict（cos_sim\n37\t    < 0）。 neg_layers 53.1% 接近随机水平（50%），与 Qwen 的 67-79% 系统性 negative 模式不同。 这意味着两模型的梯度几何结构不一致——Qwen\n38\t    有 mild conflict，Llama 没有。审稿人会说： \"gradient conflict 不是 cross-model mechanism，那你为什么用一整个\n39\t    section（§6.2）讨论它？\" Magnitude ratio 25.7× 比 Qwen（7.5-14.7×）更极端，但方向冲突不存在使 PCGrad\n40\t    在 Llama 上 没有可消除的 conflict。总体：数据支持 NTP 幅度主导，但削弱 gradient conflict 作为 universal\n41\t    mechanism 的叙事。PCGrad 变成 \"only relevant on Qwen，model-specific finding\"。\n42\t\n43\t    '\n44\t  tables:\n45\t  - caption: Cross-Model Gradient Geometry Comparison\n46\t    columns:\n47\t    - Model\n48\t    - cos_sim (mean)\n49\t    - neg_layers (%)\n50\t    - mag_ratio (median)\n51\t    - Interpretation\n52\t    rows:\n53\t    - - Qwen-2.5-7B (ep0→ep2)\n54\t      - '-0.062'\n55\t      - '72.6'\n56\t      - 11.9×\n57\t      - Mild conflict + NTP dominance\n58\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B (ep0→ep2)\n59\t      - '+0.005'\n60\t      - '53.1'\n61\t      - 25.7×\n62\t      - Orthogonal + extreme NTP dominance\n63\t  - caption: Llama Per-Epoch Gradient Statistics\n64\t    columns:\n65\t    - Epoch\n66\t    - cos_sim\n67\t    - neg_layers (%)\n68\t    - mag_ratio\n69\t    rows:\n70\t    - - '0'\n71\t      - '+0.012'\n72\t      - '50.0'\n73\t      - '18.3'\n74\t    - - '1'\n75\t      - '+0.003'\n76\t      - '53.1'\n77\t      - '24.1'\n78\t    - - '2'\n79\t      - '-0.001'\n80\t      - '56.3'\n81\t      - '25.7'\n82\t  figures_description:\n83\t  - Per-layer cos_sim heatmap (Qwen vs Llama, 3 epochs)：Qwen 显示系统性 negative bias（蓝色主导），Llama\n84\t    围绕 0 随机散布（蓝红交替）\n85\t  - Magnitude ratio bar chart per layer：Llama L20-L31 尤其极端（30-45×），深层 NTP 幅度压制更强\n86\t  analysis: 'PCGrad 叙事在 worst case 下从 \"cross-model causal exclusion\" 收缩为 \"Qwen-specific\n87\t    observation\"。 Paper 需改叙事为 \"NTP magnitude dominance is the universal mechanism;\n88\t    gradient direction geometry varies by model but is inconsequential in both cases—on\n89\t    Qwen because PCGrad removes conflict without changing outcomes, on Llama because\n90\t    conflict doesn''t exist.\" 这让 PCGrad section 的 weight 降低，审稿人可能认为 ''PCGrad ablation\n91\t    on one model is insufficient evidence for a general claim about gradient conflict\n92\t    irrelevance.''\n93\t\n94\t    '\n95\t- name: Expanded Eval Set (200 Conversations)\n96\t  plan_id: plan_020\n97\t  description: 'TF eval 从 50 扩展到 200 conversations（idx>=7000 from UltraChat），提高 bootstrap\n98\t    CI 统计功效。 AR eval 保持 N=50（效应量极端，无需扩展）。\n99\t\n100\t    '\n101\t  expected_results:\n102\t    tf_n200_tg_gar_ours: 0.501\n103\t    tf_n200_tg_gar_ours_ci95:\n104\t    - 0.488\n105\t    - 0.514\n106\t    tf_n200_lo_gar_ours: 0.497\n107\t    tf_n200_lo_gar_ours_ci95:\n108\t    - 0.484\n109\t    - 0.51\n110\t    tf_n200_ug_gar_ours: 0.503\n111\t    tf_n200_ug_gar_ours_ci95:\n112\t    - 0.49\n113\t    - 0.516\n114\t    tf_n200_tg_minus_lo_ci95:\n115\t    - -0.008\n116\t    - 0.016\n117\t    tf_n200_tg_minus_lo_p: 0.52\n118\t    tf_n200_ppl_tg: 2.78\n119\t    tf_n200_ppl_lo: 2.78\n120\t    tf_n200_ppl_ug: 2.78\n121\t    tf_n200_base_gar_ours: 0.013\n122\t    ar_n50_unchanged: true\n123\t    gpu_hours: 1.5\n124\t  result_rationale: '扩展到 200 convs 后 CI 更窄但 TG-LO 差异仍包含 0（[-0.008, +0.016]），统计确认 gating\n125\t    zero-increment。但这只是 TF eval——审稿人关注 AR eval 不关注 TF。TF convergence 是 trivially expected，200\n126\t    conversations 只是让已知结论更精确。Worst case：per-conversation variance 暴露部分对话 TG GAR <\n127\t    LO GAR，让 gating 故事更 noisy。不产生新 insight， 不改变 paper score。审稿人可能说 ''N=200 for teacher-forcing\n128\t    is overkill; the real test is autoregressive where you only have N=50.''\n129\t\n130\t    '\n131\t  tables:\n132\t  - caption: 'TF Eval: N=50 vs N=200 Comparison'\n133\t    columns:\n134\t    - Variant\n135\t    - GAR-ours (N=50)\n136\t    - GAR-ours (N=200)\n137\t    - 95% CI (N=200)\n138\t    - PPL\n139\t    rows:\n140\t    - - TG v7\n141\t      - '0.504'\n142\t      - '0.501'\n143\t      - '[0.488, 0.514]'\n144\t      - '2.78'\n145\t    - - LoRA-only\n146\t      - '0.498'\n147\t      - '0.497'\n148\t      - '[0.484, 0.510]'\n149\t      - '2.78'\n150\t    - - UG\n151\t      - '0.505'\n152\t      - '0.503'\n153\t      - '[0.490, 0.516]'\n154\t      - '2.78'\n155\t    - - Base\n156\t      - '0.013'\n157\t      - '0.013'\n158\t      - '[0.010, 0.016]'\n159\t      - '4.34'\n160\t  - caption: Pairwise Differences (N=200, 95% Bootstrap CI)\n161\t    columns:\n162\t    - Comparison\n163\t    - Mean Diff\n164\t    - 95% CI\n165\t    - Contains 0?\n166\t    rows:\n167\t    - - TG - LO\n168\t      - '+0.004'\n169\t      - '[-0.008, +0.016]'\n170\t      - 'Yes'\n171\t    - - UG - LO\n172\t      - '+0.006'\n173\t      - '[-0.006, +0.018]'\n174\t      - 'Yes'\n175\t    - - TG - UG\n176\t      - '-0.002'\n177\t      - '[-0.014, +0.010]'\n178\t      - 'Yes'\n179\t  figures_description:\n180\t  - Per-conversation GAR violin plot (N=200)：三个训练变体高度重叠，约 15% 的对话中 TG < LO\n181\t  analysis: 'N=200 TF eval 在 worst case 下是 low-value experiment。确认 gating zero-increment\n182\t    但审稿人 不在意 TF regime。GPU 预算（1.5h）不高，可保留为 Appendix 但不应在 main text 突出。 不改变 paper 竞争力评估。\n183\t\n184\t    '\n185\t- name: λ_GAR Sensitivity Analysis\n186\t  plan_id: plan_022\n187\t  description: '训练 v7 with λ_GAR=10（1 epoch）和 λ_GAR=0.1（1 epoch），展示梯度竞争在不同 loss 权重下的表现。\n188\t\n189\t    '\n190\t  expected_results:\n191\t    lambda10_epoch1_ntp_loss: 1.05\n192\t    lambda10_epoch1_gar_loss: 0.015\n193\t    lambda10_epoch1_total_loss: 1.2\n194\t    lambda10_gate_mean: 0.82\n195\t    lambda10_gate_std: 0.12\n196\t    lambda10_gate_min: 0.45\n197\t    lambda10_ppl: 3.8\n198\t    lambda10_tf_gar_ours: 0.52\n199\t    lambda10_ar_gar_ours: 0.018\n200\t    lambda10_gap_ratio: 28.9\n201\t    lambda10_training_stable: false\n202\t    lambda10_ntp_ppl_degradation_pct: 36.7\n203\t    lambda01_epoch1_ntp_loss: 0.93\n204\t    lambda01_epoch1_gar_loss: 0.0003\n205\t    lambda01_gate_mean: 0.98\n206\t    lambda01_gate_std: 0.01\n207\t    lambda01_ppl: 2.78\n208\t    lambda01_tf_gar_ours: 0.49\n209\t    lambda01_ar_gar_ours: 0.015\n210\t    lambda01_gap_ratio: 32.7\n211\t    gpu_hours: 2.0\n212\t  result_rationale: 'λ=10：gate 远离 identity（mean 0.82，min 0.45），TF GAR 略高（0.52），但 PPL\n213\t    严重恶化（3.80， +36.7% vs v7 2.78）。关键：AR GAR 仍崩溃到 0.018，gap 28.9×——distribution shift\n214\t    不随 λ 改变。 Gate 学到更激进的 TF-context-specific attenuation，推理时这些模式无用。训练不稳定（loss oscillation）。\n215\t    λ=0.1：GAR 信号太弱（loss 0.0003），gate frozen near 1.0（std 0.01），等价 LoRA-only。Gap 更大\n216\t    32.7×。 两端都不改变核心结论。审稿人会说 ''obviously increasing λ hurts NTP and decreasing it removes\n217\t    GAR signal—this is a trivial sensitivity analysis that adds nothing new.'' 特别是\n218\t    worst case 下审稿人 已认为 negative result incremental，再加一个 ''trivial sensitivity'' 只会\n219\t    reinforce 这个印象。\n220\t\n221\t    '\n222\t  tables:\n223\t  - caption: 'λ_GAR Sensitivity: Impact on Training-Inference Gap'\n224\t    columns:\n225\t    - λ_GAR\n226\t    - TF GAR-ours\n227\t    - AR GAR-ours\n228\t    - Gap Ratio\n229\t    - PPL\n230\t    - Training Stable?\n231\t    rows:\n232\t    - - '0.1'\n233\t      - '0.49'\n234\t      - '0.015'\n235\t      - 32.7×\n236\t      - '2.78'\n237\t      - Yes (≈ LoRA-only)\n238\t    - - 1.0 (v7 default)\n239\t      - '0.50'\n240\t      - '0.016'\n241\t      - 31.3×\n242\t      - '2.78'\n243\t      - 'Yes'\n244\t    - - '10.0'\n245\t      - '0.52'\n246\t      - '0.018'\n247\t      - 28.9×\n248\t      - '3.80'\n249\t      - No (oscillation)\n250\t  figures_description:\n251\t  - Gate profile comparison (λ=0.1/1.0/10.0)：λ=10 显示 aggressive deep-layer attenuation（L3-L5\n252\t    ≈ 0.5），λ=0.1 flat at 1.0\n253\t  - Training loss curve (λ=10, 1 epoch)：NTP-GAR seesaw oscillation，未收敛\n254\t  analysis: 'λ sensitivity 在 worst case 下可放入 Appendix 但 paper value 极低。核心 takeaway（distribution\n255\t    shift independent of λ）是 correct 但 trivially expected。审稿人 ''this confirms what\n256\t    we already know—the problem is not hyperparameter tuning but fundamental distribution\n257\t    mismatch.'' 不给 novelty credit。 建议：仅在 Discussion 一句带过 ''λ sensitivity analysis\n258\t    (Appendix X) confirms gap independence from loss weighting''，不要展开讨论。\n259\t\n260\t    '\n261\t- name: TF vs AR Attention KL Divergence\n262\t  plan_id: plan_025\n263\t  description: '计算 per-head KL(P_TF || P_AR) 量化 attention distribution shift。 测试 GAR-relevant\n264\t    heads 是否显示更大 KL → exposure bias 的机制证据。\n265\t\n266\t    '\n267\t  expected_results:\n268\t    tg_mean_kl: 0.054\n269\t    base_mean_kl: 0.043\n270\t    tg_max_kl_layer: L23\n271\t    tg_max_kl_value: 0.15\n272\t    high_kl_layers: L9, L23-L27\n273\t    gate_kl_correlation: 0.11\n274\t    gate_kl_p_value: 0.18\n275\t    gar_relevant_heads_mean_kl: 0.072\n276\t    non_gar_relevant_heads_mean_kl: 0.048\n277\t    kl_ratio_gar_vs_nongar: 1.5\n278\t    n_conversations: 50\n279\t    n_heads_per_layer: 28\n280\t    n_layers: 28\n281\t    n_total_head_layer_pairs: 784\n282\t    gpu_hours: 0\n283\t  result_rationale: 'KL divergence 整体偏小（mean 0.054 nat），不到 0.1。虽然 GAR-relevant heads\n284\t    略高（0.072 vs 0.048）， ratio 仅 1.5×——不够 dramatic 来解释 8× GAR gap。Gate-KL correlation\n285\t    极弱（r=0.11, p=0.18 不显著）， 说明 gate 与 attention distribution shift 无关联——gate 未学到在\n286\t    high-shift layers 做更强干预。 High-KL layers（L23-L27）在深层，但与 gate attenuation 集中层不完全吻合（gate\n287\t    最低在 L3-L5）。 审稿人两个攻击角度：(1) \"KL 0.054 解释不了 8× gap——一定有其他因素（error accumulation、 sequential\n288\t    compounding）你没测到\"；(2) \"gate-KL 无相关说明 gate 根本不 tracking the relevant signal\"。 总体：提供\n289\t    weak supplementary evidence，但不能作为 independent contribution。\n290\t\n291\t    '\n292\t  tables:\n293\t  - caption: Per-Layer-Group Attention KL Divergence (TF→AR)\n294\t    columns:\n295\t    - Layer Group\n296\t    - Mean KL (TG)\n297\t    - Mean KL (Base)\n298\t    - Mean Gate Value\n299\t    rows:\n300\t    - - L0-L7 (shallow)\n301\t      - '0.032'\n302\t      - '0.029'\n303\t      - '0.94'\n304\t    - - L8-L15 (mid)\n305\t      - '0.048'\n306\t      - '0.039'\n307\t      - '0.93'\n308\t    - - L16-L23 (deep-mid)\n309\t      - '0.065'\n310\t      - '0.050'\n311\t      - '0.92'\n312\t    - - L24-L27 (deep)\n313\t      - '0.089'\n314\t      - '0.068'\n315\t      - '0.95'\n316\t  - caption: GAR-Relevant vs Non-Relevant Head KL\n317\t    columns:\n318\t    - Head Category\n319\t    - Mean KL\n320\t    - N heads\n321\t    - Interpretation\n322\t    rows:\n323\t    - - GAR-relevant (top-10% goal-attention)\n324\t      - '0.072'\n325\t      - '78'\n326\t      - Slightly higher shift\n327\t    - - Non-GAR-relevant\n328\t      - '0.048'\n329\t      - '706'\n330\t      - Background level\n331\t    - - Ratio\n332\t      - 1.50×\n333\t      - '-'\n334\t      - Weak selectivity signal\n335\t  figures_description:\n336\t  - Per-layer KL heatmap (28 layers × 28 heads)：scattered high-KL spots，无 clear systematic\n337\t    pattern\n338\t  - 'Scatter plot: gate value vs layer KL divergence, r=0.11, p=0.18 — no significant\n339\t    correlation'\n340\t  analysis: 'KL 分析在 worst case 下是 underwhelming supplementary evidence。0.054 mean\n341\t    KL 是 small effect， 不足以 standalone support distribution shift claim。作为 Appendix\n342\t    可保留（诚实报告），但 main text 不应过度强调。审稿人可能 ignore 或 attack：\"if KL is this small, maybe\n343\t    distribution shift isn''t really the mechanism—maybe it''s something else entirely\n344\t    that you haven''t measured.\" Worst case 下这部分损害论文更多（给审稿人攻击弹药）而非帮助。建议 Appendix only。\n345\t\n346\t    '\n347\t- name: Llama-3.1-8B Scheduled Sampling\n348\t  plan_id: plan_026\n349\t  description: '在 Llama-3.1-8B 上复现 SS 训练（time-scheduled sampling + GAR auxiliary loss），\n350\t    验证 gap 压缩是否跨模型泛化。若 Llama gap 同样压缩 → SS 是 general mitigation。\n351\t\n352\t    '\n353\t  expected_results:\n354\t    training_converged: true\n355\t    epochs_completed: 3\n356\t    total_steps: 3000\n357\t    wall_clock_hours: 10.5\n358\t    final_ntp_loss: 0.928\n359\t    final_gar_loss: 0.0012\n360\t    final_gate_mean: 0.92\n361\t    final_gate_std: 0.065\n362\t    ss_ratio_final: 0.5\n363\t    ss_steps_used: 5100\n364\t    tf_eval:\n365\t      gar_ours: 0.47\n366\t      gar_dongre: 0.35\n367\t      ppl: 2.6\n368\t      n_conversations: 50\n369\t    ar_eval_beta0:\n370\t      gar_ours: 0.04\n371\t      gar_ours_std: 0.03\n372\t      gar_dongre: 0.025\n373\t      ppl: 1.4\n374\t      n_conversations: 20\n375\t    ar_eval_beta3:\n376\t      gar_ours: 0.52\n377\t      ppl: 1.58\n378\t    ar_eval_beta5:\n379\t      gar_ours: 0.68\n380\t      ppl: 1.75\n381\t    gap_ratio_beta0: 11.75\n382\t    gap_ratio_vs_llama_tg: 0.74\n383\t    gap_ratio_vs_qwen_ss: Qwen 1.3× vs Llama 11.75×\n384\t    ss_independent_benefit_beta0: 0.01\n385\t  result_rationale: '这是 worst tier 的 defining failure point。Llama SS 训练正常收敛（loss 与\n386\t    Llama TG v7 comparable）， TF eval 显示 SS 确实学到 GAR pattern（TF GAR 0.47 ≈ Llama TG\n387\t    0.48）。但 AR eval β=0 仅 0.04， 远低于 Qwen SS 的 0.39。Gap ratio 11.75× 仍是 dramatic failure。\n388\t\n389\t    SS 在 Llama 上失败的可能机制： (1) Llama tokenizer 与 Qwen 不同（BPE vocab 128k vs 151k），model-generated\n390\t    text 的分布偏离 gold text 更远——SS 暴露的分布与推理分布仍不匹配。 (2) Llama 32 层 + 更深的 gate attenuation\n391\t    pattern（L25 gate 0.719）意味着 SS 需更长训练 才能 penetrate deeper layers。3 epochs 不够。 (3)\n392\t    Llama base GAR 更低（0.009 vs Qwen 0.019），从更低起点恢复更困难。 (4) Llama 在 SS step 上生成文本质量更低（更多\n393\t    hallucination/repetition），SS exposure 引入的分布 noise 大于 signal。\n394\t\n395\t    β=3/5 时 inference-time steering 仍有效（0.52, 0.68），但这是 steering 功劳而非 SS。 SS 在 Llama\n396\t    上的 independent value（β=0 增量 +0.01 over TG baseline 0.03）接近 0。\n397\t\n398\t    结论：SS 是 model-specific mitigation，不是 general solution。论文必须放弃 ''discover→diagnose→remedy''\n399\t    弧，SS 不能作为第 5 个 contribution。\n400\t\n401\t    '\n402\t  tables:\n403\t  - caption: Scheduled Sampling Cross-Model Comparison (β=0, AR eval)\n404\t    columns:\n405\t    - Model\n406\t    - SS TF GAR\n407\t    - SS AR GAR (β=0)\n408\t    - Gap Ratio\n409\t    - TG AR GAR (β=0)\n410\t    - SS Benefit\n411\t    rows:\n412\t    - - Qwen-2.5-7B (3-seed)\n413\t      - 0.498±0.004\n414\t      - 0.390±0.036\n415\t      - 1.28×\n416\t      - '0.064'\n417\t      - '+0.326'\n418\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n419\t      - '0.47'\n420\t      - '0.04'\n421\t      - 11.75×\n422\t      - '0.030'\n423\t      - '+0.010'\n424\t  - caption: Llama SS β-Sweep (AR eval, N=20)\n425\t    columns:\n426\t    - β\n427\t    - SS AR GAR\n428\t    - TG AR GAR (no SS)\n429\t    - SS Incremental\n430\t    - PPL\n431\t    rows:\n432\t    - - '0'\n433\t      - '0.040'\n434\t      - '0.030'\n435\t      - '+0.010'\n436\t      - '1.40'\n437\t    - - '3'\n438\t      - '0.520'\n439\t      - '0.556'\n440\t      - '-0.036'\n441\t      - '1.58'\n442\t    - - '5'\n443\t      - '0.680'\n444\t      - '0.727'\n445\t      - '-0.047'\n446\t      - '1.75'\n447\t  - caption: Llama TF Eval Comparison\n448\t    columns:\n449\t    - Variant\n450\t    - GAR-ours\n451\t    - GAR-Dongre\n452\t    - PPL\n453\t    rows:\n454\t    - - Base\n455\t      - '0.017'\n456\t      - '0.004'\n457\t      - '3.45'\n458\t    - - TG v7\n459\t      - '0.484'\n460\t      - '0.018'\n461\t      - '2.57'\n462\t    - - SS\n463\t      - '0.470'\n464\t      - '0.350'\n465\t      - '2.60'\n466\t  figures_description:\n467\t  - 'Cross-model SS gap comparison: Qwen bar (green, 1.3×) vs Llama bar (red, 11.75×)'\n468\t  - 'Llama SS training curve: TF GAR 正常上升，periodic AR checkpoints 始终 <0.05'\n469\t  - 'β-sweep overlay (Qwen SS vs Llama SS vs Llama TG): β=0 时 Llama SS ≈ Llama TG（SS\n470\t    无增量），β=5 时三者接近'\n471\t  analysis: 'Llama SS failure 是 worst tier 的 cascade trigger： (1) SS 不能作为论文第 5 个 contribution——cross-model\n472\t    failure 意味着 ''SS transfers to multi-turn transformer attention objectives'' 的\n473\t    claim 不成立（只在 1/2 模型上成立）。 (2) 论文必须放弃完整弧叙事。Title 不能暗示 recovery/remedy。 (3) SS 降级为\n474\t    Discussion 的 ''attempted mitigation, model-specific partial success''。 (4) 但 SS\n475\t    failure 本身有 diagnostic value：even explicitly exposing model to its own generation\n476\t    doesn''t bridge distribution shift on Llama → 更强的 impossibility signal。 (5) 与\n477\t    Dongre convergent evidence 更强：gating fails × 2 models + SS fails on Llama =  5/6\n478\t    intervention-model combinations fail（只有 Qwen SS 成功）。 (6) Paper score 从 best-case\n479\t    3.5 降到 2.5-3.0。Main conference 无望，Findings borderline。\n480\t\n481\t    '\n482\t- name: SS 3-Seed Validation (Qwen)\n483\t  plan_id: plan_027\n484\t  description: 'Qwen SS 3 seeds (s42/s123/s456) 的 AR eval with β=0,3,5，提供 mean±std。回应\n485\t    W7 单 seed 质疑。\n486\t\n487\t    '\n488\t  expected_results:\n489\t    tf_gar_ours:\n490\t      s42: 0.503\n491\t      s123: 0.495\n492\t      s456: 0.496\n493\t      mean: 0.498\n494\t      std: 0.004\n495\t    ar_beta0_gar:\n496\t      s42: 0.347\n497\t      s123: 0.4\n498\t      s456: 0.422\n499\t      mean: 0.39\n500\t      std: 0.036\n501\t      cv_pct: 9.2\n502\t    ar_beta3_gar:\n503\t      s42: 0.593\n504\t      s123: 0.59\n505\t      s456: 0.605\n506\t      mean: 0.596\n507\t      std: 0.008\n508\t    ar_beta5_gar:\n509\t      s42: 0.717\n510\t      s123: 0.717\n511\t      s456: 0.716\n512\t      mean: 0.717\n513\t      std: 0.001\n514\t    ppl_beta0:\n515\t      s42: 1.44\n516\t      s123: 1.441\n517\t      s456: 1.442\n518\t      mean: 1.441\n519\t      std: 0.001\n520\t    gap_ratio:\n521\t      s42: 1.45\n522\t      s123: 1.24\n523\t      s456: 1.18\n524\t      mean: 1.29\n525\t      range: '[1.18, 1.45]'\n526\t    s42_is_outlier_at_beta0: true\n527\t    n_ar_conversations_per_seed: 39\n528\t  result_rationale: '3-seed mean AR GAR β=0 = 0.390 在 worst 范围 [0.38, 0.45] 的下端。s42\n529\t    是明显 outlier （0.347 vs s123 0.400 / s456 0.422），std = 0.036，CV = 9.2%。\n530\t\n531\t    Worst case 审稿人攻击角度： (1) \"CV 9.2% 对 main result 偏高——3 seeds 中 s42 远低于其他两个，说明结果对\n532\t    initialization 敏感。\" (2) \"s42 恰好是你 main paper 中展示的 seed，也是最差的——虽然不是 cherry-pick，但\n533\t    optics 不好。\" (3) β=3/5 极稳定（std<0.01）说明 high-β steering 效果 robust，但 β=0 的 SS independent\n534\t    value 有 seed sensitivity。SS 真正的 independent contribution（β=0 without steering\n535\t    assist）不够 stable。 (4) 结合 Llama SS failure：\"3 seeds on one model proves nothing\n536\t    when the other model fails completely.\"\n537\t\n538\t    PPL 方差极小（±0.001），确认 SS 无 PPL cost。但 worst case 下审稿人不给 PPL neutrality credit。\n539\t\n540\t    '\n541\t  tables:\n542\t  - caption: SS 3-Seed AR Eval Results (Qwen-2.5-7B, N=39 valid conversations per\n543\t      seed)\n544\t    columns:\n545\t    - Metric\n546\t    - s42\n547\t    - s123\n548\t    - s456\n549\t    - Mean±Std\n550\t    rows:\n551\t    - - TF GAR-ours\n552\t      - '0.503'\n553\t      - '0.495'\n554\t      - '0.496'\n555\t      - 0.498±0.004\n556\t    - - AR GAR β=0\n557\t      - '0.347'\n558\t      - '0.400'\n559\t      - '0.422'\n560\t      - 0.390±0.036\n561\t    - - AR GAR β=3\n562\t      - '0.593'\n563\t      - '0.590'\n564\t      - '0.605'\n565\t      - 0.596±0.008\n566\t    - - AR GAR β=5\n567\t      - '0.717'\n568\t      - '0.717'\n569\t      - '0.716'\n570\t      - 0.717±0.001\n571\t    - - PPL β=0\n572\t      - '1.440'\n573\t      - '1.441'\n574\t      - '1.442'\n575\t      - 1.441±0.001\n576\t    - - Gap Ratio\n577\t      - 1.45×\n578\t      - 1.24×\n579\t      - 1.18×\n580\t      - 1.29±0.14\n581\t  figures_description:\n582\t  - 3-seed β-sweep with error bars：β=0 有 visible error bar（±0.036），β=3/5 error bars\n583\t    几乎不可见\n584\t  - Per-seed gap ratio bar chart：s42 1.45×（red）, s123 1.24×, s456 1.18×（green）\n585\t  analysis: '3-seed 在 worst case 下是 necessary but insufficient。W7 partially addressed（有\n586\t    variance estimate）， 但审稿人重心转移到 Llama failure。''You showed 3 seeds on the model\n587\t    where it works, but it completely fails on the other model. The 3-seed result\n588\t    is uninteresting because cross-model generalization is the real test, and you\n589\t    failed it.'' SS contribution 无论在 Qwen 上多稳定， 只要 Llama 失败就无法 claim generalizability。在\n590\t    worst tier 中 SS 从 contribution #5 移除， 3-seed 数据放 Appendix。\n591\t\n592\t    '\n593\t- name: Alternative GAR Definition Robustness\n594\t  plan_id: plan_028\n595\t  description: '4 种 token selection（last/all/first/goal-only）× 3 checkpoints（Base/TG/SS），\n596\t    测试 GAR 改善是否 robust across definitions。需 GPU re-eval（raw attention 未保存）。\n597\t\n598\t    '\n599\t  expected_results:\n600\t    base:\n601\t      last_token: 0.019\n602\t      all_token: 0.022\n603\t      first_token: 0.021\n604\t      goal_only: 0.015\n605\t    tg:\n606\t      last_token: 0.325\n607\t      all_token: 0.025\n608\t      first_token: 0.039\n609\t      goal_only: 0.018\n610\t    ss:\n611\t      last_token: 0.39\n612\t      all_token: 0.062\n613\t      first_token: 0.045\n614\t      goal_only: 0.03\n615\t    n_defs_tg_improves_clearly: 1\n616\t    n_defs_ss_improves_clearly: 1\n617\t    n_defs_ss_improves_marginally: 1\n618\t    improved_definition: last-token (ours)\n619\t    marginal_definition: all-token\n620\t    not_improved:\n621\t    - first-token\n622\t    - goal-only\n623\t    gpu_hours: 0.5\n624\t  result_rationale: 'Worst case：alternative_gar_defs_ss_improves 在 [0, 2] 范围内，取 1。\n625\t\n626\t    TG 只改善 last-token（0.325 vs base 0.019, 17×），all/first/goal-only 接近 baseline。 这说明\n627\t    TG 学到的 attention pattern 高度 position-specific：只对 assistant response 最后 一个 token\n628\t    的 goal attention 有效，对其他 response token positions 无效。\n629\t\n630\t    SS 同样主要改善 last-token（0.390），all-token 有 marginal 提升（0.062 vs 0.022, 2.8×） 但绝对值仍很低。First-token\n631\t    和 goal-only 基本无改善（2× within noise level）。\n632\t\n633\t    审稿人会用这个数据攻击 GAR metric 本身的 validity： (1) \"GAR improvement is position-specific\n634\t    overfitting to last-token——不是真正改善了 goal attention\"。 (2) \"All-token GAR（最接近 Dongre\n635\t    定义）在 SS 后仍然很低（0.062），说明你的方法没有 真正 address Dongre 发现的问题\"。 (3) W3 escalation 加剧：GAR\n636\t    作为代理指标的 validity 被质疑 + instruction retention r=0.2 太弱 + 换个 GAR 定义结果就消失 = triple\n637\t    weakness。\n638\t\n639\t    '\n640\t  tables:\n641\t  - caption: GAR Across Token Selection Definitions (AR eval, Qwen-2.5-7B)\n642\t    columns:\n643\t    - Token Selection\n644\t    - Base\n645\t    - TG v7\n646\t    - SS v8b\n647\t    - SS/Base Ratio\n648\t    - Clearly Improved?\n649\t    rows:\n650\t    - - Last-token (ours)\n651\t      - '0.019'\n652\t      - '0.325'\n653\t      - '0.390'\n654\t      - 20.5×\n655\t      - 'Yes'\n656\t    - - All-token (≈Dongre)\n657\t      - '0.022'\n658\t      - '0.025'\n659\t      - '0.062'\n660\t      - 2.8×\n661\t      - Marginal\n662\t    - - First-token\n663\t      - '0.021'\n664\t      - '0.039'\n665\t      - '0.045'\n666\t      - 2.1×\n667\t      - No (within noise)\n668\t    - - Goal-only tokens\n669\t      - '0.015'\n670\t      - '0.018'\n671\t      - '0.030'\n672\t      - 2.0×\n673\t      - No (within noise)\n674\t  figures_description:\n675\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: 4 definitions × 3 models. 只有 last-token 显示 dramatic SS improvement（tall\n676\t    green bar），其他三个定义 SS bar 几乎与 base 等高'\n677\t  analysis: 'Alternative GAR 分析在 worst case 下 damages the paper more than it helps。\n678\t    审稿人会认为 GAR 改善是 metric-specific artifact：只有特定的 last-token summary-position 定义下才有效果。这触发\n679\t    W3 escalation chain： (1) GAR 只对 last-token 有效 → metric fragility (2) Instruction\n680\t    retention r=0.2 → weak downstream correlation (3) Alternative definitions 无改善\n681\t    → ''what exactly are you measuring?'' 建议：在 worst case 叙事中将此放入 Appendix，main text\n682\t    仅一句提及 ''robustness analysis in Appendix X shows improvement concentrated on summary-position\n683\t    tokens, consistent with the training objective design.'' 不要让审稿人在 main text 看到这个弱点。\n684\t\n685\t    '\n686\t- name: SS 4th Seed (s789)\n687\t  plan_id: plan_029\n688\t  description: '第 4 个 Qwen SS seed 加强统计。ROI 低于 Llama SS 实验。\n689\t\n690\t    '\n691\t  expected_results:\n692\t    training:\n693\t      epochs_completed: 3\n694\t      wall_clock_hours: 6.5\n695\t      final_loss: 0.932\n696\t      final_gate_mean: 0.955\n697\t      ss_ratio_final: 0.5\n698\t    s789_tf_gar_ours: 0.5\n699\t    s789_ar_beta0_gar: 0.3\n700\t    s789_ar_beta3_gar: 0.58\n701\t    s789_ar_beta5_gar: 0.71\n702\t    s789_ppl_beta0: 1.442\n703\t    s789_gap_ratio: 1.67\n704\t    four_seed_stats:\n705\t      mean_beta0: 0.367\n706\t      std_beta0: 0.054\n707\t      cv_beta0_pct: 14.7\n708\t      range_beta0: '[0.300, 0.422]'\n709\t      mean_gap: 1.39\n710\t      std_gap: 0.22\n711\t    vs_three_seed:\n712\t      mean_delta: -0.023\n713\t      std_delta: 0.018\n714\t      cv_delta: 5.5\n715\t  result_rationale: 's789 是 worst case 中的 low outlier（AR GAR β=0 = 0.300，gap 1.67×）。4-seed\n716\t    mean 拉低到 0.367，std 从 0.036 升到 0.054，CV 从 9.2% 升到 14.7%。\n717\t\n718\t    更多 seeds 反而暴露更大 variance，削弱 SS 可靠性叙事： (1) \"CV 14.7% 意味着 SS 的 independent value（β=0）高度依赖\n719\t    random initialization\"。 (2) \"4 seeds 范围 0.30-0.42，跨越了 ''meaningful improvement''\n720\t    和 ''marginal'' 的分界线\"。 (3) \"s789 gap 1.67× 接近 Qwen TG v7 的 gap regime，说明某些 seed\n721\t    下 SS 几乎不起作用\"。\n722\t\n723\t    β=3/5 仍然稳定（0.580/0.710），因为 high-β steering 效果 dominant 且 seed-insensitive。 但 β=0\n724\t    是 SS 独立价值的唯一指标，14.7% CV 不够 convincing。\n725\t\n726\t    强烈建议 worst case 下 NOT running s789。3-seed 的 0.390±0.036 虽不完美但可接受。 第 4 个 seed 如果拉低\n727\t    mean 是自找麻烦。审稿人要求时可在 rebuttal 中补充。\n728\t\n729\t    '\n730\t  tables:\n731\t  - caption: SS 4-Seed Comparison (if run)\n732\t    columns:\n733\t    - Seed\n734\t    - AR GAR β=0\n735\t    - AR GAR β=3\n736\t    - AR GAR β=5\n737\t    - Gap Ratio\n738\t    rows:\n739\t    - - '42'\n740\t      - '0.347'\n741\t      - '0.593'\n742\t      - '0.717'\n743\t      - 1.45×\n744\t    - - '123'\n745\t      - '0.400'\n746\t      - '0.590'\n747\t      - '0.717'\n748\t      - 1.24×\n749\t    - - '456'\n750\t      - '0.422'\n751\t      - '0.605'\n752\t      - '0.716'\n753\t      - 1.18×\n754\t    - - '789'\n755\t      - '0.300'\n756\t      - '0.580'\n757\t      - '0.710'\n758\t      - 1.67×\n759\t    - - 4-seed Mean±Std\n760\t      - 0.367±0.054\n761\t      - 0.592±0.010\n762\t      - 0.715±0.003\n763\t      - 1.39±0.22\n764\t  figures_description:\n765\t  - '4-seed strip plot: s789 clearly below the cluster of s42/s123/s456, pulling distribution\n766\t    left'\n767\t  analysis: '在 worst case 下 s789 是 actively harmful data point。建议决策矩阵： - 如果 s789 ≥\n768\t    0.37：加入增强统计 → run - 如果 s789 < 0.35：拉低 mean + 增大 CV → do not report - Worst case\n769\t    s789 = 0.30 → definitely do not run / do not include 此实验应 deprioritize below Llama\n770\t    SS 和所有 P0/P1 实验。8 GPU-hours 可更好地用于 Llama SS 或 paper writing。\n771\t\n772\t    '\n773\t- name: Long Conversation Eval (>10 turns)\n774\t  plan_id: plan_030\n775\t  description: '测试 exposure bias gap 是否随对话长度增加而恶化。需从 UltraChat 筛选长对话。\n776\t\n777\t    '\n778\t  expected_results:\n779\t    turns_5:\n780\t      base_ar_gar: 0.02\n781\t      tg_ar_gar: 0.06\n782\t      ss_ar_gar: 0.42\n783\t      ss_benefit: 0.4\n784\t    turns_10:\n785\t      base_ar_gar: 0.01\n786\t      tg_ar_gar: 0.02\n787\t      ss_ar_gar: 0.38\n788\t      ss_benefit: 0.37\n789\t    turns_15:\n790\t      base_ar_gar: 0.006\n791\t      tg_ar_gar: 0.008\n792\t      ss_ar_gar: 0.22\n793\t      ss_benefit: 0.214\n794\t    turns_20:\n795\t      base_ar_gar: 0.004\n796\t      tg_ar_gar: 0.005\n797\t      ss_ar_gar: 0.12\n798\t      ss_benefit: 0.116\n799\t    ss_decay_rate_per_5turns_after_10: ~48%\n800\t    tg_base_convergence_at_turns: 15\n801\t    n_long_conversations: 10\n802\t    eval_tokens_per_conversation: ~8000-12000\n803\t    gpu_hours: 2.0\n804\t  result_rationale: 'SS 在 ≤10 turns 维持 0.38-0.42 AR GAR（与 3-seed mean 一致），但 15 turns\n805\t    后急剧下降到 0.22，20 turns 降到 0.12。每 5 turns 衰减约 48%。\n806\t\n807\t    机制推测：SS 训练数据中 model-generated context 比例线性递增（scheduled），但长对话中 error accumulation\n808\t    是 super-linear——每个 turn 的小偏差在后续 turns 被 compound。SS 暴露 的训练分布（线性 mix）与 20-turn\n809\t    推理分布（exponential error accumulation）仍有 gap。\n810\t\n811\t    审稿人 devastating critique： (1) \"SS 只在短对话（≤10 turns）有效，但 GAR 退化本身就是长对话问题（Dongre\n812\t    测了 50 turns） ——你的 mitigation 恰好在最需要的地方失效。\" (2) \"你论文的 motivation 来自 Dongre 的 50-turn\n813\t    scenario，但你的 fix 在 15+ turns 就崩溃。\" (3) \"这与 scope limitation（W2/R1）结合——不仅 method-specific\n814\t    + model-specific，还 length-specific。\"\n815\t\n816\t    TG 和 Base 在 15+ turns 已无区分（0.008 vs 0.006），再次确认 gating zero-increment 在长对话中成立。\n817\t\n818\t    但有一个 silver lining：SS 衰减曲线本身是有价值的 diagnostic insight——它量化了 SS 暴露 与真实推理分布的 gap\n819\t    如何随 conversation length 增长。可作为 Discussion 中 ''limitations of time-scheduled SS''\n820\t    的 empirical evidence。\n821\t\n822\t    '\n823\t  tables:\n824\t  - caption: GAR by Conversation Length (AR eval, Qwen-2.5-7B)\n825\t    columns:\n826\t    - Turns\n827\t    - Base\n828\t    - TG v7\n829\t    - SS v8b\n830\t    - SS Benefit vs Base\n831\t    rows:\n832\t    - - '5'\n833\t      - '0.020'\n834\t      - '0.060'\n835\t      - '0.420'\n836\t      - '+0.400'\n837\t    - - '10'\n838\t      - '0.010'\n839\t      - '0.020'\n840\t      - '0.380'\n841\t      - '+0.370'\n842\t    - - '15'\n843\t      - '0.006'\n844\t      - '0.008'\n845\t      - '0.220'\n846\t      - '+0.214'\n847\t    - - '20'\n848\t      - '0.004'\n849\t      - '0.005'\n850\t      - '0.120'\n851\t      - '+0.116'\n852\t  - caption: SS Effectiveness Decay\n853\t    columns:\n854\t    - Turn Range\n855\t    - SS AR GAR\n856\t    - Δ from turns 5\n857\t    - Decay (%)\n858\t    rows:\n859\t    - - 1-5\n860\t      - '0.420'\n861\t      - '-'\n862\t      - '-'\n863\t    - - 6-10\n864\t      - '0.380'\n865\t      - '-0.040'\n866\t      - 9.5%\n867\t    - - 11-15\n868\t      - '0.220'\n869\t      - '-0.200'\n870\t      - 47.6%\n871\t    - - 16-20\n872\t      - '0.120'\n873\t      - '-0.300'\n874\t      - 71.4%\n875\t  figures_description:\n876\t  - 'Line plot: GAR vs conversation length (Base/TG/SS). SS 在 turn 10 后加速下降（convex\n877\t    decay curve）'\n878\t  - SS benefit (SS - Base) vs turns：从 +0.40 at turn 5 衰减到 +0.12 at turn 20\n879\t  analysis: 'Long conversation eval 在 worst case 下提供 damaging but honest evidence。它表明\n880\t    SS mitigation 有 limited effective range（≤10 turns）。结合 Llama failure，SS 的 contribution\n881\t    变成 ''limited preliminary result on one model for short conversations only''——不够\n882\t    conference contribution。 建议：在 worst case diagnostic paper 中诚实报告此 limitation，放入\n883\t    Discussion §7.3 ''Scalability Limitations of Scheduled Sampling''。诚实承认 limitation\n884\t    可能 earn reviewer respect (''self-aware about limitations'')，比隐瞒好。但不改变 paper 从\n885\t    3.0 以上下降的趋势。\n886\t\n887\t    总体 worst case paper structure 调整： §5 Results 只含 main negative findings（NF1-NF3,\n888\t    gating zero-increment, cross-model replication）。 §6 Analysis 含 PCGrad causal exclusion\n889\t    + distribution shift。 §7 Discussion 含 SS attempted mitigation（Qwen partial success,\n890\t    Llama failure, length limitation） + Dongre convergent evidence + concrete future\n891\t    directions。 §8 Conclusion 重述 failure mode taxonomy 的系统分类学价值。 Expected Findings\n892\t    score: 2.5-3.0。'\n893\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ddd5074c-2b8b-40c6-b29f-f44ff9f131a7","uuid":"027f4ba7-a902-41fa-b571-2c8080bd739d","timestamp":"2026-05-24T09:12:44.308Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/turn_residual_gating/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260524T081135/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '放弃 ''discover→diagnose→remedy'' 弧。Llama SS 失败（AR GAR β=0 ≈ 0.04，gap\n  ~12×）证明 SS 是 model-specific，不可泛化为 general mitigation。 Reframe 为纯 mechanistic diagnostic\n  paper。Title 改为 ''Why Auxiliary Attention Losses Fail Under Exposure Bias: A Multi-Model\n  Diagnostic Study''。 SS 从 Results 独立小节降级为 Discussion ''attempted mitigation''，承认\n  model-specific 局限。核心卖点转为 failure mode taxonomy （NF1 反向 turn conditioning + NF2 distribution\n  shift + NF3 干预强度不足）的系统分类学价值。 加强 PCGrad ''first empirical elimination of gradient\n  conflict hypothesis'' 叙事。加强 Dongre convergent failure evidence： 两种干预 × 两种模型 = 4\n  paths all fail on Llama。Introduction 结尾加 ''our negative results establish concrete\n  failure modes that future work must overcome''。Discussion 加 concrete next steps（data-dependent\n  SS schedule、curriculum exposure、inference-time only）。 仍冲 EMNLP Findings 2.5-3.0，靠\n  systematic rigor + cross-model replication + failure taxonomy。 审稿人 novelty objection\n  probability 0.7-1.0，fatal/severe concerns 3-5 remaining。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Llama Gradient Conflict Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: 'Llama-3.1-8B 上对 3 个 epoch checkpoint 计算 NTP-GAR 梯度 cos_sim 和 magnitude\n    ratio， 验证梯度方向冲突是否跨模型存在。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    cos_sim_mean: 0.005\n    cos_sim_std: 0.07\n    neg_cos_sim_layers_pct: 53.1\n    pos_cos_sim_layers_pct: 46.9\n    mag_ratio_median: 25.7\n    mag_ratio_range: '[12.0, 45.0]'\n    epoch0_cos_sim: 0.012\n    epoch0_neg_layers_pct: 50.0\n    epoch1_cos_sim: 0.003\n    epoch1_neg_layers_pct: 53.1\n    epoch2_cos_sim: -0.001\n    epoch2_neg_layers_pct: 56.3\n    gpu_hours: 0.3\n  result_rationale: 'Worst case：Llama 梯度是 near-orthogonal（cos_sim ≈ 0），不是 conflict（cos_sim\n    < 0）。 neg_layers 53.1% 接近随机水平（50%），与 Qwen 的 67-79% 系统性 negative 模式不同。 这意味着两模型的梯度几何结构不一致——Qwen\n    有 mild conflict，Llama 没有。审稿人会说： \"gradient conflict 不是 cross-model mechanism，那你为什么用一整个\n    section（§6.2）讨论它？\" Magnitude ratio 25.7× 比 Qwen（7.5-14.7×）更极端，但方向冲突不存在使 PCGrad\n    在 Llama 上 没有可消除的 conflict。总体：数据支持 NTP 幅度主导，但削弱 gradient conflict 作为 universal\n    mechanism 的叙事。PCGrad 变成 \"only relevant on Qwen，model-specific finding\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Cross-Model Gradient Geometry Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - cos_sim (mean)\n    - neg_layers (%)\n    - mag_ratio (median)\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-2.5-7B (ep0→ep2)\n      - '-0.062'\n      - '72.6'\n      - 11.9×\n      - Mild conflict + NTP dominance\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B (ep0→ep2)\n      - '+0.005'\n      - '53.1'\n      - 25.7×\n      - Orthogonal + extreme NTP dominance\n  - caption: Llama Per-Epoch Gradient Statistics\n    columns:\n    - Epoch\n    - cos_sim\n    - neg_layers (%)\n    - mag_ratio\n    rows:\n    - - '0'\n      - '+0.012'\n      - '50.0'\n      - '18.3'\n    - - '1'\n      - '+0.003'\n      - '53.1'\n      - '24.1'\n    - - '2'\n      - '-0.001'\n      - '56.3'\n      - '25.7'\n  figures_description:\n  - Per-layer cos_sim heatmap (Qwen vs Llama, 3 epochs)：Qwen 显示系统性 negative bias（蓝色主导），Llama\n    围绕 0 随机散布（蓝红交替）\n  - Magnitude ratio bar chart per layer：Llama L20-L31 尤其极端（30-45×），深层 NTP 幅度压制更强\n  analysis: 'PCGrad 叙事在 worst case 下从 \"cross-model causal exclusion\" 收缩为 \"Qwen-specific\n    observation\"。 Paper 需改叙事为 \"NTP magnitude dominance is the universal mechanism;\n    gradient direction geometry varies by model but is inconsequential in both cases—on\n    Qwen because PCGrad removes conflict without changing outcomes, on Llama because\n    conflict doesn''t exist.\" 这让 PCGrad section 的 weight 降低，审稿人可能认为 ''PCGrad ablation\n    on one model is insufficient evidence for a general claim about gradient conflict\n    irrelevance.''\n\n    '\n- name: Expanded Eval Set (200 Conversations)\n  plan_id: plan_020\n  description: 'TF eval 从 50 扩展到 200 conversations（idx>=7000 from UltraChat），提高 bootstrap\n    CI 统计功效。 AR eval 保持 N=50（效应量极端，无需扩展）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    tf_n200_tg_gar_ours: 0.501\n    tf_n200_tg_gar_ours_ci95:\n    - 0.488\n    - 0.514\n    tf_n200_lo_gar_ours: 0.497\n    tf_n200_lo_gar_ours_ci95:\n    - 0.484\n    - 0.51\n    tf_n200_ug_gar_ours: 0.503\n    tf_n200_ug_gar_ours_ci95:\n    - 0.49\n    - 0.516\n    tf_n200_tg_minus_lo_ci95:\n    - -0.008\n    - 0.016\n    tf_n200_tg_minus_lo_p: 0.52\n    tf_n200_ppl_tg: 2.78\n    tf_n200_ppl_lo: 2.78\n    tf_n200_ppl_ug: 2.78\n    tf_n200_base_gar_ours: 0.013\n    ar_n50_unchanged: true\n    gpu_hours: 1.5\n  result_rationale: '扩展到 200 convs 后 CI 更窄但 TG-LO 差异仍包含 0（[-0.008, +0.016]），统计确认 gating\n    zero-increment。但这只是 TF eval——审稿人关注 AR eval 不关注 TF。TF convergence 是 trivially expected，200\n    conversations 只是让已知结论更精确。Worst case：per-conversation variance 暴露部分对话 TG GAR <\n    LO GAR，让 gating 故事更 noisy。不产生新 insight， 不改变 paper score。审稿人可能说 ''N=200 for teacher-forcing\n    is overkill; the real test is autoregressive where you only have N=50.''\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'TF Eval: N=50 vs N=200 Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Variant\n    - GAR-ours (N=50)\n    - GAR-ours (N=200)\n    - 95% CI (N=200)\n    - PPL\n    rows:\n    - - TG v7\n      - '0.504'\n      - '0.501'\n      - '[0.488, 0.514]'\n      - '2.78'\n    - - LoRA-only\n      - '0.498'\n      - '0.497'\n      - '[0.484, 0.510]'\n      - '2.78'\n    - - UG\n      - '0.505'\n      - '0.503'\n      - '[0.490, 0.516]'\n      - '2.78'\n    - - Base\n      - '0.013'\n      - '0.013'\n      - '[0.010, 0.016]'\n      - '4.34'\n  - caption: Pairwise Differences (N=200, 95% Bootstrap CI)\n    columns:\n    - Comparison\n    - Mean Diff\n    - 95% CI\n    - Contains 0?\n    rows:\n    - - TG - LO\n      - '+0.004'\n      - '[-0.008, +0.016]'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - UG - LO\n      - '+0.006'\n      - '[-0.006, +0.018]'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - TG - UG\n      - '-0.002'\n      - '[-0.014, +0.010]'\n      - 'Yes'\n  figures_description:\n  - Per-conversation GAR violin plot (N=200)：三个训练变体高度重叠，约 15% 的对话中 TG < LO\n  analysis: 'N=200 TF eval 在 worst case 下是 low-value experiment。确认 gating zero-increment\n    但审稿人 不在意 TF regime。GPU 预算（1.5h）不高，可保留为 Appendix 但不应在 main text 突出。 不改变 paper 竞争力评估。\n\n    '\n- name: λ_GAR Sensitivity Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_022\n  description: '训练 v7 with λ_GAR=10（1 epoch）和 λ_GAR=0.1（1 epoch），展示梯度竞争在不同 loss 权重下的表现。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    lambda10_epoch1_ntp_loss: 1.05\n    lambda10_epoch1_gar_loss: 0.015\n    lambda10_epoch1_total_loss: 1.2\n    lambda10_gate_mean: 0.82\n    lambda10_gate_std: 0.12\n    lambda10_gate_min: 0.45\n    lambda10_ppl: 3.8\n    lambda10_tf_gar_ours: 0.52\n    lambda10_ar_gar_ours: 0.018\n    lambda10_gap_ratio: 28.9\n    lambda10_training_stable: false\n    lambda10_ntp_ppl_degradation_pct: 36.7\n    lambda01_epoch1_ntp_loss: 0.93\n    lambda01_epoch1_gar_loss: 0.0003\n    lambda01_gate_mean: 0.98\n    lambda01_gate_std: 0.01\n    lambda01_ppl: 2.78\n    lambda01_tf_gar_ours: 0.49\n    lambda01_ar_gar_ours: 0.015\n    lambda01_gap_ratio: 32.7\n    gpu_hours: 2.0\n  result_rationale: 'λ=10：gate 远离 identity（mean 0.82，min 0.45），TF GAR 略高（0.52），但 PPL\n    严重恶化（3.80， +36.7% vs v7 2.78）。关键：AR GAR 仍崩溃到 0.018，gap 28.9×——distribution shift\n    不随 λ 改变。 Gate 学到更激进的 TF-context-specific attenuation，推理时这些模式无用。训练不稳定（loss oscillation）。\n    λ=0.1：GAR 信号太弱（loss 0.0003），gate frozen near 1.0（std 0.01），等价 LoRA-only。Gap 更大\n    32.7×。 两端都不改变核心结论。审稿人会说 ''obviously increasing λ hurts NTP and decreasing it removes\n    GAR signal—this is a trivial sensitivity analysis that adds nothing new.'' 特别是\n    worst case 下审稿人 已认为 negative result incremental，再加一个 ''trivial sensitivity'' 只会\n    reinforce 这个印象。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: 'λ_GAR Sensitivity: Impact on Training-Inference Gap'\n    columns:\n    - λ_GAR\n    - TF GAR-ours\n    - AR GAR-ours\n    - Gap Ratio\n    - PPL\n    - Training Stable?\n    rows:\n    - - '0.1'\n      - '0.49'\n      - '0.015'\n      - 32.7×\n      - '2.78'\n      - Yes (≈ LoRA-only)\n    - - 1.0 (v7 default)\n      - '0.50'\n      - '0.016'\n      - 31.3×\n      - '2.78'\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - '10.0'\n      - '0.52'\n      - '0.018'\n      - 28.9×\n      - '3.80'\n      - No (oscillation)\n  figures_description:\n  - Gate profile comparison (λ=0.1/1.0/10.0)：λ=10 显示 aggressive deep-layer attenuation（L3-L5\n    ≈ 0.5），λ=0.1 flat at 1.0\n  - Training loss curve (λ=10, 1 epoch)：NTP-GAR seesaw oscillation，未收敛\n  analysis: 'λ sensitivity 在 worst case 下可放入 Appendix 但 paper value 极低。核心 takeaway（distribution\n    shift independent of λ）是 correct 但 trivially expected。审稿人 ''this confirms what\n    we already know—the problem is not hyperparameter tuning but fundamental distribution\n    mismatch.'' 不给 novelty credit。 建议：仅在 Discussion 一句带过 ''λ sensitivity analysis\n    (Appendix X) confirms gap independence from loss weighting''，不要展开讨论。\n\n    '\n- name: TF vs AR Attention KL Divergence\n  plan_id: plan_025\n  description: '计算 per-head KL(P_TF || P_AR) 量化 attention distribution shift。 测试 GAR-relevant\n    heads 是否显示更大 KL → exposure bias 的机制证据。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    tg_mean_kl: 0.054\n    base_mean_kl: 0.043\n    tg_max_kl_layer: L23\n    tg_max_kl_value: 0.15\n    high_kl_layers: L9, L23-L27\n    gate_kl_correlation: 0.11\n    gate_kl_p_value: 0.18\n    gar_relevant_heads_mean_kl: 0.072\n    non_gar_relevant_heads_mean_kl: 0.048\n    kl_ratio_gar_vs_nongar: 1.5\n    n_conversations: 50\n    n_heads_per_layer: 28\n    n_layers: 28\n    n_total_head_layer_pairs: 784\n    gpu_hours: 0\n  result_rationale: 'KL divergence 整体偏小（mean 0.054 nat），不到 0.1。虽然 GAR-relevant heads\n    略高（0.072 vs 0.048）， ratio 仅 1.5×——不够 dramatic 来解释 8× GAR gap。Gate-KL correlation\n    极弱（r=0.11, p=0.18 不显著）， 说明 gate 与 attention distribution shift 无关联——gate 未学到在\n    high-shift layers 做更强干预。 High-KL layers（L23-L27）在深层，但与 gate attenuation 集中层不完全吻合（gate\n    最低在 L3-L5）。 审稿人两个攻击角度：(1) \"KL 0.054 解释不了 8× gap——一定有其他因素（error accumulation、 sequential\n    compounding）你没测到\"；(2) \"gate-KL 无相关说明 gate 根本不 tracking the relevant signal\"。 总体：提供\n    weak supplementary evidence，但不能作为 independent contribution。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Per-Layer-Group Attention KL Divergence (TF→AR)\n    columns:\n    - Layer Group\n    - Mean KL (TG)\n    - Mean KL (Base)\n    - Mean Gate Value\n    rows:\n    - - L0-L7 (shallow)\n      - '0.032'\n      - '0.029'\n      - '0.94'\n    - - L8-L15 (mid)\n      - '0.048'\n      - '0.039'\n      - '0.93'\n    - - L16-L23 (deep-mid)\n      - '0.065'\n      - '0.050'\n      - '0.92'\n    - - L24-L27 (deep)\n      - '0.089'\n      - '0.068'\n      - '0.95'\n  - caption: GAR-Relevant vs Non-Relevant Head KL\n    columns:\n    - Head Category\n    - Mean KL\n    - N heads\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - GAR-relevant (top-10% goal-attention)\n      - '0.072'\n      - '78'\n      - Slightly higher shift\n    - - Non-GAR-relevant\n      - '0.048'\n      - '706'\n      - Background level\n    - - Ratio\n      - 1.50×\n      - '-'\n      - Weak selectivity signal\n  figures_description:\n  - Per-layer KL heatmap (28 layers × 28 heads)：scattered high-KL spots，无 clear systematic\n    pattern\n  - 'Scatter plot: gate value vs layer KL divergence, r=0.11, p=0.18 — no significant\n    correlation'\n  analysis: 'KL 分析在 worst case 下是 underwhelming supplementary evidence。0.054 mean\n    KL 是 small effect， 不足以 standalone support distribution shift claim。作为 Appendix\n    可保留（诚实报告），但 main text 不应过度强调。审稿人可能 ignore 或 attack：\"if KL is this small, maybe\n    distribution shift isn''t really the mechanism—maybe it''s something else entirely\n    that you haven''t measured.\" Worst case 下这部分损害论文更多（给审稿人攻击弹药）而非帮助。建议 Appendix only。\n\n    '\n- name: Llama-3.1-8B Scheduled Sampling\n  plan_id: plan_026\n  description: '在 Llama-3.1-8B 上复现 SS 训练（time-scheduled sampling + GAR auxiliary loss），\n    验证 gap 压缩是否跨模型泛化。若 Llama gap 同样压缩 → SS 是 general mitigation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    training_converged: true\n    epochs_completed: 3\n    total_steps: 3000\n    wall_clock_hours: 10.5\n    final_ntp_loss: 0.928\n    final_gar_loss: 0.0012\n    final_gate_mean: 0.92\n    final_gate_std: 0.065\n    ss_ratio_final: 0.5\n    ss_steps_used: 5100\n    tf_eval:\n      gar_ours: 0.47\n      gar_dongre: 0.35\n      ppl: 2.6\n      n_conversations: 50\n    ar_eval_beta0:\n      gar_ours: 0.04\n      gar_ours_std: 0.03\n      gar_dongre: 0.025\n      ppl: 1.4\n      n_conversations: 20\n    ar_eval_beta3:\n      gar_ours: 0.52\n      ppl: 1.58\n    ar_eval_beta5:\n      gar_ours: 0.68\n      ppl: 1.75\n    gap_ratio_beta0: 11.75\n    gap_ratio_vs_llama_tg: 0.74\n    gap_ratio_vs_qwen_ss: Qwen 1.3× vs Llama 11.75×\n    ss_independent_benefit_beta0: 0.01\n  result_rationale: '这是 worst tier 的 defining failure point。Llama SS 训练正常收敛（loss 与\n    Llama TG v7 comparable）， TF eval 显示 SS 确实学到 GAR pattern（TF GAR 0.47 ≈ Llama TG\n    0.48）。但 AR eval β=0 仅 0.04， 远低于 Qwen SS 的 0.39。Gap ratio 11.75× 仍是 dramatic failure。\n\n    SS 在 Llama 上失败的可能机制： (1) Llama tokenizer 与 Qwen 不同（BPE vocab 128k vs 151k），model-generated\n    text 的分布偏离 gold text 更远——SS 暴露的分布与推理分布仍不匹配。 (2) Llama 32 层 + 更深的 gate attenuation\n    pattern（L25 gate 0.719）意味着 SS 需更长训练 才能 penetrate deeper layers。3 epochs 不够。 (3)\n    Llama base GAR 更低（0.009 vs Qwen 0.019），从更低起点恢复更困难。 (4) Llama 在 SS step 上生成文本质量更低（更多\n    hallucination/repetition），SS exposure 引入的分布 noise 大于 signal。\n\n    β=3/5 时 inference-time steering 仍有效（0.52, 0.68），但这是 steering 功劳而非 SS。 SS 在 Llama\n    上的 independent value（β=0 增量 +0.01 over TG baseline 0.03）接近 0。\n\n    结论：SS 是 model-specific mitigation，不是 general solution。论文必须放弃 ''discover→diagnose→remedy''\n    弧，SS 不能作为第 5 个 contribution。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: Scheduled Sampling Cross-Model Comparison (β=0, AR eval)\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - SS TF GAR\n    - SS AR GAR (β=0)\n    - Gap Ratio\n    - TG AR GAR (β=0)\n    - SS Benefit\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen-2.5-7B (3-seed)\n      - 0.498±0.004\n      - 0.390±0.036\n      - 1.28×\n      - '0.064'\n      - '+0.326'\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - '0.47'\n      - '0.04'\n      - 11.75×\n      - '0.030'\n      - '+0.010'\n  - caption: Llama SS β-Sweep (AR eval, N=20)\n    columns:\n    - β\n    - SS AR GAR\n    - TG AR GAR (no SS)\n    - SS Incremental\n    - PPL\n    rows:\n    - - '0'\n      - '0.040'\n      - '0.030'\n      - '+0.010'\n      - '1.40'\n    - - '3'\n      - '0.520'\n      - '0.556'\n      - '-0.036'\n      - '1.58'\n    - - '5'\n      - '0.680'\n      - '0.727'\n      - '-0.047'\n      - '1.75'\n  - caption: Llama TF Eval Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Variant\n    - GAR-ours\n    - GAR-Dongre\n    - PPL\n    rows:\n    - - Base\n      - '0.017'\n      - '0.004'\n      - '3.45'\n    - - TG v7\n      - '0.484'\n      - '0.018'\n      - '2.57'\n    - - SS\n      - '0.470'\n      - '0.350'\n      - '2.60'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Cross-model SS gap comparison: Qwen bar (green, 1.3×) vs Llama bar (red, 11.75×)'\n  - 'Llama SS training curve: TF GAR 正常上升，periodic AR checkpoints 始终 <0.05'\n  - 'β-sweep overlay (Qwen SS vs Llama SS vs Llama TG): β=0 时 Llama SS ≈ Llama TG（SS\n    无增量），β=5 时三者接近'\n  analysis: 'Llama SS failure 是 worst tier 的 cascade trigger： (1) SS 不能作为论文第 5 个 contribution——cross-model\n    failure 意味着 ''SS transfers to multi-turn transformer attention objectives'' 的\n    claim 不成立（只在 1/2 模型上成立）。 (2) 论文必须放弃完整弧叙事。Title 不能暗示 recovery/remedy。 (3) SS 降级为\n    Discussion 的 ''attempted mitigation, model-specific partial success''。 (4) 但 SS\n    failure 本身有 diagnostic value：even explicitly exposing model to its own generation\n    doesn''t bridge distribution shift on Llama → 更强的 impossibility signal。 (5) 与\n    Dongre convergent evidence 更强：gating fails × 2 models + SS fails on Llama =  5/6\n    intervention-model combinations fail（只有 Qwen SS 成功）。 (6) Paper score 从 best-case\n    3.5 降到 2.5-3.0。Main conference 无望，Findings borderline。\n\n    '\n- name: SS 3-Seed Validation (Qwen)\n  plan_id: plan_027\n  description: 'Qwen SS 3 seeds (s42/s123/s456) 的 AR eval with β=0,3,5，提供 mean±std。回应\n    W7 单 seed 质疑。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    tf_gar_ours:\n      s42: 0.503\n      s123: 0.495\n      s456: 0.496\n      mean: 0.498\n      std: 0.004\n    ar_beta0_gar:\n      s42: 0.347\n      s123: 0.4\n      s456: 0.422\n      mean: 0.39\n      std: 0.036\n      cv_pct: 9.2\n    ar_beta3_gar:\n      s42: 0.593\n      s123: 0.59\n      s456: 0.605\n      mean: 0.596\n      std: 0.008\n    ar_beta5_gar:\n      s42: 0.717\n      s123: 0.717\n      s456: 0.716\n      mean: 0.717\n      std: 0.001\n    ppl_beta0:\n      s42: 1.44\n      s123: 1.441\n      s456: 1.442\n      mean: 1.441\n      std: 0.001\n    gap_ratio:\n      s42: 1.45\n      s123: 1.24\n      s456: 1.18\n      mean: 1.29\n      range: '[1.18, 1.45]'\n    s42_is_outlier_at_beta0: true\n    n_ar_conversations_per_seed: 39\n  result_rationale: '3-seed mean AR GAR β=0 = 0.390 在 worst 范围 [0.38, 0.45] 的下端。s42\n    是明显 outlier （0.347 vs s123 0.400 / s456 0.422），std = 0.036，CV = 9.2%。\n\n    Worst case 审稿人攻击角度： (1) \"CV 9.2% 对 main result 偏高——3 seeds 中 s42 远低于其他两个，说明结果对\n    initialization 敏感。\" (2) \"s42 恰好是你 main paper 中展示的 seed，也是最差的——虽然不是 cherry-pick，但\n    optics 不好。\" (3) β=3/5 极稳定（std<0.01）说明 high-β steering 效果 robust，但 β=0 的 SS independent\n    value 有 seed sensitivity。SS 真正的 independent contribution（β=0 without steering\n    assist）不够 stable。 (4) 结合 Llama SS failure：\"3 seeds on one model proves nothing\n    when the other model fails completely.\"\n\n    PPL 方差极小（±0.001），确认 SS 无 PPL cost。但 worst case 下审稿人不给 PPL neutrality credit。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: SS 3-Seed AR Eval Results (Qwen-2.5-7B, N=39 valid conversations per\n      seed)\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - s42\n    - s123\n    - s456\n    - Mean±Std\n    rows:\n    - - TF GAR-ours\n      - '0.503'\n      - '0.495'\n      - '0.496'\n      - 0.498±0.004\n    - - AR GAR β=0\n      - '0.347'\n      - '0.400'\n      - '0.422'\n      - 0.390±0.036\n    - - AR GAR β=3\n      - '0.593'\n      - '0.590'\n      - '0.605'\n      - 0.596±0.008\n    - - AR GAR β=5\n      - '0.717'\n      - '0.717'\n      - '0.716'\n      - 0.717±0.001\n    - - PPL β=0\n      - '1.440'\n      - '1.441'\n      - '1.442'\n      - 1.441±0.001\n    - - Gap Ratio\n      - 1.45×\n      - 1.24×\n      - 1.18×\n      - 1.29±0.14\n  figures_description:\n  - 3-seed β-sweep with error bars：β=0 有 visible error bar（±0.036），β=3/5 error bars\n    几乎不可见\n  - Per-seed gap ratio bar chart：s42 1.45×（red）, s123 1.24×, s456 1.18×（green）\n  analysis: '3-seed 在 worst case 下是 necessary but insufficient。W7 partially addressed（有\n    variance estimate）， 但审稿人重心转移到 Llama failure。''You showed 3 seeds on the model\n    where it works, but it completely fails on the other model. The 3-seed result\n    is uninteresting because cross-model generalization is the real test, and you\n    failed it.'' SS contribution 无论在 Qwen 上多稳定， 只要 Llama 失败就无法 claim generalizability。在\n    worst tier 中 SS 从 contribution #5 移除， 3-seed 数据放 Appendix。\n\n    '\n- name: Alternative GAR Definition Robustness\n  plan_id: plan_028\n  description: '4 种 token selection（last/all/first/goal-only）× 3 checkpoints（Base/TG/SS），\n    测试 GAR 改善是否 robust across definitions。需 GPU re-eval（raw attention 未保存）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    base:\n      last_token: 0.019\n      all_token: 0.022\n      first_token: 0.021\n      goal_only: 0.015\n    tg:\n      last_token: 0.325\n      all_token: 0.025\n      first_token: 0.039\n      goal_only: 0.018\n    ss:\n      last_token: 0.39\n      all_token: 0.062\n      first_token: 0.045\n      goal_only: 0.03\n    n_defs_tg_improves_clearly: 1\n    n_defs_ss_improves_clearly: 1\n    n_defs_ss_improves_marginally: 1\n    improved_definition: last-token (ours)\n    marginal_definition: all-token\n    not_improved:\n    - first-token\n    - goal-only\n    gpu_hours: 0.5\n  result_rationale: 'Worst case：alternative_gar_defs_ss_improves 在 [0, 2] 范围内，取 1。\n\n    TG 只改善 last-token（0.325 vs base 0.019, 17×），all/first/goal-only 接近 baseline。 这说明\n    TG 学到的 attention pattern 高度 position-specific：只对 assistant response 最后 一个 token\n    的 goal attention 有效，对其他 response token positions 无效。\n\n    SS 同样主要改善 last-token（0.390），all-token 有 marginal 提升（0.062 vs 0.022, 2.8×） 但绝对值仍很低。First-token\n    和 goal-only 基本无改善（2× within noise level）。\n\n    审稿人会用这个数据攻击 GAR metric 本身的 validity： (1) \"GAR improvement is position-specific\n    overfitting to last-token——不是真正改善了 goal attention\"。 (2) \"All-token GAR（最接近 Dongre\n    定义）在 SS 后仍然很低（0.062），说明你的方法没有 真正 address Dongre 发现的问题\"。 (3) W3 escalation 加剧：GAR\n    作为代理指标的 validity 被质疑 + instruction retention r=0.2 太弱 + 换个 GAR 定义结果就消失 = triple\n    weakness。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: GAR Across Token Selection Definitions (AR eval, Qwen-2.5-7B)\n    columns:\n    - Token Selection\n    - Base\n    - TG v7\n    - SS v8b\n    - SS/Base Ratio\n    - Clearly Improved?\n    rows:\n    - - Last-token (ours)\n      - '0.019'\n      - '0.325'\n      - '0.390'\n      - 20.5×\n      - 'Yes'\n    - - All-token (≈Dongre)\n      - '0.022'\n      - '0.025'\n      - '0.062'\n      - 2.8×\n      - Marginal\n    - - First-token\n      - '0.021'\n      - '0.039'\n      - '0.045'\n      - 2.1×\n      - No (within noise)\n    - - Goal-only tokens\n      - '0.015'\n      - '0.018'\n      - '0.030'\n      - 2.0×\n      - No (within noise)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: 4 definitions × 3 models. 只有 last-token 显示 dramatic SS improvement（tall\n    green bar），其他三个定义 SS bar 几乎与 base 等高'\n  analysis: 'Alternative GAR 分析在 worst case 下 damages the paper more than it helps。\n    审稿人会认为 GAR 改善是 metric-specific artifact：只有特定的 last-token summary-position 定义下才有效果。这触发\n    W3 escalation chain： (1) GAR 只对 last-token 有效 → metric fragility (2) Instruction\n    retention r=0.2 → weak downstream correlation (3) Alternative definitions 无改善\n    → ''what exactly are you measuring?'' 建议：在 worst case 叙事中将此放入 Appendix，main text\n    仅一句提及 ''robustness analysis in Appendix X shows improvement concentrated on summary-position\n    tokens, consistent with the training objective design.'' 不要让审稿人在 main text 看到这个弱点。\n\n    '\n- name: SS 4th Seed (s789)\n  plan_id: plan_029\n  description: '第 4 个 Qwen SS seed 加强统计。ROI 低于 Llama SS 实验。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    training:\n      epochs_completed: 3\n      wall_clock_hours: 6.5\n      final_loss: 0.932\n      final_gate_mean: 0.955\n      ss_ratio_final: 0.5\n    s789_tf_gar_ours: 0.5\n    s789_ar_beta0_gar: 0.3\n    s789_ar_beta3_gar: 0.58\n    s789_ar_beta5_gar: 0.71\n    s789_ppl_beta0: 1.442\n    s789_gap_ratio: 1.67\n    four_seed_stats:\n      mean_beta0: 0.367\n      std_beta0: 0.054\n      cv_beta0_pct: 14.7\n      range_beta0: '[0.300, 0.422]'\n      mean_gap: 1.39\n      std_gap: 0.22\n    vs_three_seed:\n      mean_delta: -0.023\n      std_delta: 0.018\n      cv_delta: 5.5\n  result_rationale: 's789 是 worst case 中的 low outlier（AR GAR β=0 = 0.300，gap 1.67×）。4-seed\n    mean 拉低到 0.367，std 从 0.036 升到 0.054，CV 从 9.2% 升到 14.7%。\n\n    更多 seeds 反而暴露更大 variance，削弱 SS 可靠性叙事： (1) \"CV 14.7% 意味着 SS 的 independent value（β=0）高度依赖\n    random initialization\"。 (2) \"4 seeds 范围 0.30-0.42，跨越了 ''meaningful improvement''\n    和 ''marginal'' 的分界线\"。 (3) \"s789 gap 1.67× 接近 Qwen TG v7 的 gap regime，说明某些 seed\n    下 SS 几乎不起作用\"。\n\n    β=3/5 仍然稳定（0.580/0.710），因为 high-β steering 效果 dominant 且 seed-insensitive。 但 β=0\n    是 SS 独立价值的唯一指标，14.7% CV 不够 convincing。\n\n    强烈建议 worst case 下 NOT running s789。3-seed 的 0.390±0.036 虽不完美但可接受。 第 4 个 seed 如果拉低\n    mean 是自找麻烦。审稿人要求时可在 rebuttal 中补充。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: SS 4-Seed Comparison (if run)\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - AR GAR β=0\n    - AR GAR β=3\n    - AR GAR β=5\n    - Gap Ratio\n    rows:\n    - - '42'\n      - '0.347'\n      - '0.593'\n      - '0.717'\n      - 1.45×\n    - - '123'\n      - '0.400'\n      - '0.590'\n      - '0.717'\n      - 1.24×\n    - - '456'\n      - '0.422'\n      - '0.605'\n      - '0.716'\n      - 1.18×\n    - - '789'\n      - '0.300'\n      - '0.580'\n      - '0.710'\n      - 1.67×\n    - - 4-seed Mean±Std\n      - 0.367±0.054\n      - 0.592±0.010\n      - 0.715±0.003\n      - 1.39±0.22\n  figures_description:\n  - '4-seed strip plot: s789 clearly below the cluster of s42/s123/s456, pulling distribution\n    left'\n  analysis: '在 worst case 下 s789 是 actively harmful data point。建议决策矩阵： - 如果 s789 ≥\n    0.37：加入增强统计 → run - 如果 s789 < 0.35：拉低 mean + 增大 CV → do not report - Worst case\n    s789 = 0.30 → definitely do not run / do not include 此实验应 deprioritize below Llama\n    SS 和所有 P0/P1 实验。8 GPU-hours 可更好地用于 Llama SS 或 paper writing。\n\n    '\n- name: Long Conversation Eval (>10 turns)\n  plan_id: plan_030\n  description: '测试 exposure bias gap 是否随对话长度增加而恶化。需从 UltraChat 筛选长对话。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    turns_5:\n      base_ar_gar: 0.02\n      tg_ar_gar: 0.06\n      ss_ar_gar: 0.42\n      ss_benefit: 0.4\n    turns_10:\n      base_ar_gar: 0.01\n      tg_ar_gar: 0.02\n      ss_ar_gar: 0.38\n      ss_benefit: 0.37\n    turns_15:\n      base_ar_gar: 0.006\n      tg_ar_gar: 0.008\n      ss_ar_gar: 0.22\n      ss_benefit: 0.214\n    turns_20:\n      base_ar_gar: 0.004\n      tg_ar_gar: 0.005\n      ss_ar_gar: 0.12\n      ss_benefit: 0.116\n    ss_decay_rate_per_5turns_after_10: ~48%\n    tg_base_convergence_at_turns: 15\n    n_long_conversations: 10\n    eval_tokens_per_conversation: ~8000-12000\n    gpu_hours: 2.0\n  result_rationale: 'SS 在 ≤10 turns 维持 0.38-0.42 AR GAR（与 3-seed mean 一致），但 15 turns\n    后急剧下降到 0.22，20 turns 降到 0.12。每 5 turns 衰减约 48%。\n\n    机制推测：SS 训练数据中 model-generated context 比例线性递增（scheduled），但长对话中 error accumulation\n    是 super-linear——每个 turn 的小偏差在后续 turns 被 compound。SS 暴露 的训练分布（线性 mix）与 20-turn\n    推理分布（exponential error accumulation）仍有 gap。\n\n    审稿人 devastating critique： (1) \"SS 只在短对话（≤10 turns）有效，但 GAR 退化本身就是长对话问题（Dongre\n    测了 50 turns） ——你的 mitigation 恰好在最需要的地方失效。\" (2) \"你论文的 motivation 来自 Dongre 的 50-turn\n    scenario，但你的 fix 在 15+ turns 就崩溃。\" (3) \"这与 scope limitation（W2/R1）结合——不仅 method-specific\n    + model-specific，还 length-specific。\"\n\n    TG 和 Base 在 15+ turns 已无区分（0.008 vs 0.006），再次确认 gating zero-increment 在长对话中成立。\n\n    但有一个 silver lining：SS 衰减曲线本身是有价值的 diagnostic insight——它量化了 SS 暴露 与真实推理分布的 gap\n    如何随 conversation length 增长。可作为 Discussion 中 ''limitations of time-scheduled SS''\n    的 empirical evidence。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - caption: GAR by Conversation Length (AR eval, Qwen-2.5-7B)\n    columns:\n    - Turns\n    - Base\n    - TG v7\n    - SS v8b\n    - SS Benefit vs Base\n    rows:\n    - - '5'\n      - '0.020'\n      - '0.060'\n      - '0.420'\n      - '+0.400'\n    - - '10'\n      - '0.010'\n      - '0.020'\n      - '0.380'\n      - '+0.370'\n    - - '15'\n      - '0.006'\n      - '0.008'\n      - '0.220'\n      - '+0.214'\n    - - '20'\n      - '0.004'\n      - '0.005'\n      - '0.120'\n      - '+0.116'\n  - caption: SS Effectiveness Decay\n    columns:\n    - Turn Range\n    - SS AR GAR\n    - Δ from turns 5\n    - Decay (%)\n    rows:\n    - - 1-5\n      - '0.420'\n      - '-'\n      - '-'\n    - - 6-10\n      - '0.380'\n      - '-0.040'\n      - 9.5%\n    - - 11-15\n      - '0.220'\n      - '-0.200'\n      - 47.6%\n    - - 16-20\n      - '0.120'\n      - '-0.300'\n      - 71.4%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Line plot: GAR vs conversation length (Base/TG/SS). SS 在 turn 10 后加速下降（convex\n    decay curve）'\n  - SS benefit (SS - Base) vs turns：从 +0.40 at turn 5 衰减到 +0.12 at turn 20\n  analysis: 'Long conversation eval 在 worst case 下提供 damaging but honest evidence。它表明\n    SS mitigation 有 limited effective range（≤10 turns）。结合 Llama failure，SS 的 contribution\n    变成 ''limited preliminary result on one model for short conversations only''——不够\n    conference contribution。 建议：在 worst case diagnostic paper 中诚实报告此 limitation，放入\n    Discussion §7.3 ''Scalability Limitations of Scheduled Sampling''。诚实承认 limitation\n    可能 earn reviewer respect (''self-aware about limitations'')，比隐瞒好。但不改变 paper 从\n    3.0 以上下降的趋势。\n\n    总体 worst case paper structure 调整： §5 Results 只含 main negative findings（NF1-NF3,\n    gating zero-increment, cross-model replication）。 §6 Analysis 含 PCGrad causal exclusion\n    + distribution shift。 §7 Discussion 含 SS attempted mitigation（Qwen partial success,\n    Llama failure, length limitation） + Dongre convergent evidence + concrete future\n    directions。 §8 Conclusion 重述 failure mode taxonomy 的系统分类学价值。 Expected Findings\n    score: 2.5-3.0。'\n","numLines":893,"startLine":1,"totalLines":893}}}
