{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01U8thEG7VsioKXPDR3K8LFj","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\\section{Limitations}\\label{sec:limitations}\n2\t\n3\tOur findings are demonstrated on two model families (Qwen-2.5-7B and Llama-3.1-8B), one dataset (UltraChat, 8K conversations), and most configurations use a single seed (scheduled sampling validated on three seeds; \\S\\ref{subsec:ss}); quality assessment relies on PPL rather than comprehensive benchmarks \\citep{hendrycks2021measuring,lin2022truthfulqa}. We test only one auxiliary loss family (GAR with MSE target $\\tau$\\,=\\,0.5); head-specific or layer-specific losses may exhibit different sensitivity to exposure bias. The PCGrad exclusion addresses gradient direction conflict only; magnitude imbalance \\citep{chen2018gradnorm} and Nash equilibrium approaches \\citep{navon2022nash} remain untested."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_012rxFdQJP73N7w2vLdbnKsU","session_id":"ddd5074c-2b8b-40c6-b29f-f44ff9f131a7","uuid":"f50ce83c-4dac-4ad3-891b-7b9d44e73f86","timestamp":"2026-05-24T09:14:55.030Z"}
